ine\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C19cb2302-L14\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  body</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token constant\">JSON</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C19cb2302-L15\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">    query</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token template-string template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token template-string string\">mutation {</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C19cb2302-L16\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token template-string string\">      productUpdate(product: { id: \"gid://shopify/Product/123\", title: \"Restocked: Acme Mug\" }) {</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C19cb2302-L17\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token template-string string\">        product { id }</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C19cb2302-L18\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token template-string string\">      }</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C19cb2302-L19\" st